# Project-local cache and weight dumps stay untracked.
# load_model() writes named checkpoints to ~/.cache/whisper or
# $XDG_CACHE_HOME/whisper. --model_dir / download_root can point
# inside this checkout. A local weights/, cache/, or checkpoints/
# dump stays untracked.
